of <span class="plainlinks">in do touheerige [{{fullurl:{{#special:Log}}|page={{FULLPAGENAMEE}}}} Logbouke säike].</span>',
	'messages:userpage-userdoesnotexist' => 'stq:Dät Benutserkonto „<nowiki>$1</nowiki>“ is nit deer. Pröif, of du disse Siede wuddelk moakje/beoarbaidje wolt.',
